  {
   "settings": {
    "analyzable": {
     "text": {
      "orig": "Food Collector",
      "transl": "Essenssammler"
     }
    },
    "npcStates": [
     {
      "event": {
       "quest": [
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Hi!",
          "transl": "Привіт!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Waaah...!\nDon't be so loud! Do you want THEM to hear you?",
          "transl": "Uaaah...!\nSei nicht so laut! Willst du, dass SIE dich hören?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...?",
          "transl": "...?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_AWAY"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I'm talking about those thieving Bovines!\\. They've ambushed me and stole all the fruits and herbs I've been gathering!",
          "transl": "Ich meine diese diebischen Rinder!\\. Sie haben mich in einen Hinterhalt gelockt und mir all meine Früchte und Kräuter geklaut, die ich gesammelt habe!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Look at that beast, grazing there like nothing happened!\\. And there's more of them in the bushes, just waiting for a victim!",
          "transl": "Schau dir dieses Biest an, grast da rum, als wäre nichts passiert.\\. Da sind aber noch mehr. Die verstecken sich in den Büschen und warten nur auf ihre Opfer!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "But... you were sent to help me, right?\\. I worked all day collecting that stuff, we need to get it back!",
          "transl": "Aber... du wurdest geschickt, um mir zu helfen, stimmt's?\\. Ich habe den ganzen Tag gebraucht, um all das zu sammeln - wir müssen es zurückholen!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[nickt]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Well...\\. you have to do it.\\. I have to...\\. watch for reinforcements.\\. So...\\. good luck!",
          "transl": "Das heißt...\\. öhm...\\. du musst es tun!\\. Ich muss hier doch...\\. nach Verstärkung Ausschau halten!\\. Genau!\\. Also...\\. Viel Glück!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": ".\\..\\..",
          "transl": ".\\..\\.."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "MOPING"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "event": [
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Go slaughter them and bring me the package!\\. I'll be right here, surveying the situation!",
         "transl": "Geh sie schlachten und bring mir das Essenspaket!\\. Ich bleibe hier und behalte die Situation im Auge!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": ".\\..\\..",
         "transl": ".\\..\\.."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "ANNOYED"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "event": [
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Great work!\\. Now... please bring me the package?\\. I don't trust this silence.",
         "transl": "Großartig! Gute Arbeit!\\. Würdest du mir bitte noch das Essenspaket holen?\\. Ich traue dieser Stille nicht."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": ".\\..\\..",
         "transl": ".\\..\\.."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "ANNOYED"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "event": {
       "quest": [
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "There they are, the fruits of my labor!\\. Literally.",
          "transl": "Da sind sie, die Früchte meiner Arbeit!\\. Buchstäblich."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...!",
          "transl": "...!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SMUG"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Thanks a bunch!\\. You totally saved my butt here!\\. But now I gotta get going and deliver these before it's too late.\\. So...\\. bye!",
          "transl": "Vielen Dank nochmal!\\. Du hast mir hier total den Hintern gerettet!\\. Aber nun muss ich los und sie abliefern, bevor es zu spät ist.\\. Also...\\. Tschüssi!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "adventurers.female-dut-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[nickt]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ]
   }
  },
